Each party must maintain the following types of insurance throughout the term of the contract:

a. Commercial General Liability insurance;  
b. Professional Liability / Errors & Omissions insurance;  
c. Cyber Liability insurance;  
d. Workers Compensation insurance;  
e. Any additional insurance required by Applicable Laws or the applicable Project Agreement.  

Certificates of insurance must also be provided upon reasonable request [1].

